Confirm selection","privacy.consent.settings.button.selectAll":"Select all","privacy.consent.settings.less":"Less information","privacy.consent.settings.marketing.text":"We retain information about how you use our website to create better offers within the scope of direct marketing activities and campaigns. We are responsible for this storage and management of data processing.","privacy.consent.settings.marketing.title":"Marketing","privacy.consent.settings.more":"More information","privacy.consent.settings.partnership.text":"We also use cookies to show you individual products and services not on our website. Information about your user behavior is, therefore, transmitted to partner companies in order to display content personalized by us or these partners in accordance with your interests.\\n\\nWe or our partners can evaluate, track, and issue invoices for these campaigns. Other advertising companies can also read cookies within this category and display personalized content to you. Responsibility for the use of your data beyond our processing lies with these companies and is carried out without our involvement.","privacy.consent.settings.partnership.title":"Partnerships","privacy.consent.settings.stats.text":"We use cookies to get a better understanding of your user behavior and to help you find your way around our website. We also use this data to modify the website so it better suits your needs.","privacy.consent.settings.stats.title":"Statistics","privacy.consent.settings.tech.text":"Website navigation is made possible by technically necessary cookies. Basic functions such as displaying and selecting products, or logging in are not possible without them.","privacy.consent.settings.tech.title":"Required","privacy.consent.settings.title":"Cookie Settings","privacy.consent.text":"We want to make your visit to our website a pleasurable experience by continuously optimizing the site and its individual offers. We collect information from our visitors in order to do this, and cookies (also from third parties) play an important role here. It’s up to you to decide which cookies are allowed.\\n\\nYour data will only be transmitted in encrypted form. Technically necessary cookies are also enabled when you select <a name=decline>Decline</a>.\\n\\nYou can change your settings later at the bottom of the page under \\"Cookies\\".","privacy.consent.title":"Cookies at HiDrive","privacy.title":"Privacy Policy","privacy.url":"","protocolInfo.close":"Close window","protocolInfo.headline":"server names and URLs","protocolInfo.hint":"The following protocols are not included in your tariff and may require a tariff change: {0}","quota.legend.usedbydevicebackups":"Device Backup","quota.legend.usedbyfiles":"Files","quota.legend.usedbysnapshots":"Backups","quota.text.default":"Storage space {0} of {1} occupied","quota.text.short":"{0} of {1}","quota.text.used":"occupied","reauth.submit":"Relogin","reauth.title.nouser":"Your session has expired","scrollToTop":"Scroll to top","search.cancelled":"Your search has been cancelled.","search.category":"Type","search.category.multiple":"{0} Types","search.clear":"Remove","search.date":"Date","search.date.byDays":"Last {0} days","search.date.lastYear":"Last year","search.date.thisYear":"This year","search.date.today":"Today","search.filemanager.header.path":"File path","search.loading":"Searching...","search.openParent":"Open file path","search.placeholder":"Search in folders","search.result.empty":"No search results were found.","search.result.error":"An error occurred while searching.","search.result.header":"Search result","search.result.hint.toomany":"Your search produced too many hits. Only {0} matches are shown. Please refine your search criteria.","section.buttons.cancel":"Cancel","section.buttons.save":"Save","section.edit":"Edit","section.saving":"Saving settings…","settings.edit":"Edit settings","settings.load.error":"Sorry, something went wrong.","settings.password.buttons.cancel":"Cancel","settin